{"reviewId": "279966354_7ZSs3hVN8", "review": {"abstract": "“金砖四国”很大意义上并没有超脱现有的世界产业分工链条，并成为真正的增量因素，仍然与世界经济周期同生死、共荣辱。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "金砖国家、上合组织，政治意义大于经济意义。包括2013年开始赔钱搞一带一路时质疑的声音也很多，现在再看不得不说大国有高人，虽身不入中东，但对中东影响之深已经很明显了，这就是从一带一路开始的。毕竟中东是世界格局最重要的一环，既是亚欧非链接要塞又是能源要地，大国博弈离不开中东。美英如此，美苏如此，中美亦如此。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "17045-17101", "createTime": 1746292143, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "279966354_7ZSs3hVN8", "userVid": 279966354, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 279966354, "name": "NAMI-歪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epm52h3dJuDvNO6WB3zUw9qQ2NrSr7f9WzZYAbwjsZgkCAXuC9j5iaXQ3mvbVUJhUcOLuEoGrfroyw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "探索、透视客观世界规律", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "提升意识能量，自在喜乐", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 18, "likes": [{"userVid": 414458585, "name": "🌲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-qHEk9NbwnipEQVkzI37JJ10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天